font>&lt;/li>&lt;/ul>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;div>&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: x-large; ">&lt;u>Direct Control:&lt;/u>&lt;/span>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;div>&lt;div>&lt;ul>&lt;li>&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: x-large; ">Use Alt-Click to interact.&lt;/span>&lt;/li>&lt;/ul>&lt;/div>&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">&lt;div>&lt;div>&lt;div>&lt;div>&lt;div>&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium; ">&lt;div>&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">&lt;div>&lt;div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium; ">&lt;div>&lt;div>&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: x-large; ">&lt;u>Local Control:&lt;/u>&lt;/span>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;div>&lt;ul>&lt;li>&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: x-large; ">N/A&lt;/span>&lt;/li>&lt;/ul>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/font>&lt;/div>&lt;/font>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/font>&lt;div>&lt;div>&lt;div>&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">&lt;u>Remote Control:&lt;/u>&lt;/font>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;div>&lt;ul>&lt;li>&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: x-large; ">N/A&lt;/span>&lt;/li>&lt;/ul>&lt;/div>&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">&lt;div>&lt;div>&lt;div>&lt;div>&lt;div>&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">&lt;div>&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">&lt;div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium; ">&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">&lt;u>Data Specification:&lt;/u>&lt;/font>&lt;/div>&lt;/font>&lt;/div>&lt;/font>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/font>&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: x-large; ">INPUT SLOT: 0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: x-large; ">&lt;div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium; ">&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">OUTPUT SLOTS: 1, 2, 3&lt;/font>&lt;/div>&lt;div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium; ">&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">&lt;br>&lt;/font>&lt;/div>&lt;div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium; ">&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">&lt;div>&lt;div>&lt;div>&lt;div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium; ">&lt;div>&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">&lt;div>&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">&lt;div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium; ">&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">INPUT SLOT: A0&lt;/font>&lt;/div>&lt;/font>&lt;/div>&lt;/font>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;/font>&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: x-large; ">&lt;div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium; ">&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">OUTPUT SLOTS: A1, A2, A3&lt;/font>&lt;/div>&lt;div>&lt;font class="Apple-style-span" face="Arial" size="5">&lt;br>&lt;/font>&lt;/div>&lt;/span>&lt;/font>&lt;/div>&lt;div>&lt;u>Example:&lt;/u>&lt;/div>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: x-large; ">Connect a Push Button to slot 0 and 3 LEDs to slots 1, 2, and 3 of this toggle switch. Play with both Push Button and this switch to observe the behavior. Similar function can be achieved for the use of analog interface.&lt;/span>&lt;/div>&lt;/body>&lt;/html></SPECIFICATIONS>
